<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-FAI Cup second round results.</title>
<headline>Soccer-FAI Cup second round results.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Football Association of Ireland (FAI) senior cup second round ties played on Sunday.</p>
<p>    Cork City	   4  St.Francis		1</p>
<p>    Shelbourne	  4  Dundalk		   2</p>
<p>Played on Saturday</p>
<p>    Dublin University 0  Bray Wanderers	  3</p>
<p>    Drogheda United   2  Rockmount F.C.	  1</p>
<p>    Sligo Rovers	0  St.Patrick's Athletic 1</p>
<p>    Derry City	  2  Home Farm/Everton     1</p>
<p>Played on Friday</p>
<p>    Bohemians	   2 Wayside Celtic	   0</p>
<p>    Waterford United  1 Shamrock Rovers	  0</p>
<p>--Damien Lynch, Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
